	(text "Rovi M4 wiring -- ESP32-S3 + 2x TB6612FNG + 4 motors + power bank" (at 40.64 25.4 0) (effects (font (size 2.5 2.5)) (justify left)) (uuid "6f50fa86-b493-5cc4-8ed1-c71a9ec43362"))
	(text "Rovi M4 wiring: four TT motors, two TB6612FNG drivers, ESP32-S3, 5 V power bank. Same pins as WIRING.md.\nNets join by label name. M1's wiring is D1 channel A (GPIO4-7) and is kept; everything new is on the ESP32 left header.\nOne STBY line (GPIO4) for both drivers: low from boot and unless armed; the TB6612 pull-down holds it low in reset.\nSkipped: GPIO18 (high glitch at power-up), GPIO3/46 (strapping). Firmware CHANNELS: D1 A=FL, D1 B=RL, D2 A=FR, D2 B=RR.\nNo current monitor, dead-man or bench supply (ADR-0014)." (at 40.64 165.1 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left top)) (uuid "0b371f98-a8ec-5892-b1b2-62f0494435e6"))
